        "Description": "Since the breakout of Claus Strandberg streets of Marrakesh are in turmoil. Vile socialist protesters, terrorists from Red Dawn, foreign state actors threaten the peace and prosperity of local business. General Zaydan generously offered protection for those who wish to continue their trade in this daring time. But some greedy pigs thought they were better  than that, thought they were safe and refused the goodwill of our great general. Prove them wrong!",
